@startuml ERD
title Entity-Relationship Diagram — Sample Vault

skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
hide empty members

class roles <<table>> {
  + id : INT <<PK>>
  + name : VARCHAR(20) <<UNIQUE>>
}

class users <<table>> {
  + id : INT <<PK>>
  + username : VARCHAR(50) <<UNIQUE>>
  + password : VARCHAR(255)
  + created_at : TIMESTAMP
}

class users_roles <<table>> {
  + user_id : INT <<FK>>
  + role_id : INT <<FK>>
  + __PK: (user_id, role_id)__
}

class samples <<table>> {
  + id : INT <<PK>>
  + user_id : INT <<FK>>
  + filename : VARCHAR(255)
  + display_name : VARCHAR(100)
  + category : VARCHAR(50) <<NULL>>
  + bpm : INT
  + file_path : VARCHAR(255)
  + created_at : TIMESTAMP
}

' Relaciones
roles ||--o{ users_roles : "1 tiene N"
users ||--o{ users_roles : "1 tiene N"
users ||--o{ samples : "1 posee N"

note right of users_roles
  ON DELETE CASCADE
  (ambas FKs)
end note

note right of samples
  ON DELETE CASCADE
  FK → users(id)
end note

note right of roles
  Datos semilla:
  - admin
  - producer
end note

legend right
  **Stored Procedures**
  ____ users ____
  sp_find_user_by_username
  sp_create_user
  sp_find_all_users
  sp_delete_user
  ____ samples ____
  sp_create_sample
  sp_find_samples_by_user
  sp_find_sample_by_id
  sp_delete_sample
  ____ grants ____
  DB User: samplevault
  Grants: SELECT, EXECUTE
end legend
@enduml